  {  403789, "Transform into a Demon, increasing Armor by $403816s1%, Health by $403816s6%, reducing the chance you will be critically hit by $403816s2%, increasing your threat by $403816s3%, increasing mana gained from Life Tap by $403816s4%, but reducing all damage you deal by $403816s5%. Metamorphosis transforms the functionality of some abilities and grants new ones:\r\n\r\nSearing Pain: Now instant.\r\n\r\nShadow Bolt: Becomes Shadow Cleave, a Shadow melee attack that hits up to $403835x1 nearby enemies, but has a $s6 sec cooldown.\r\n\r\nFear: Replaced with Menace.\r\n\r\n$@spellicon403828\r\n$@spelldesc403828\r\n\r\n\r\nDemon Charge\r\n\r\n$@spellicon412788\r\n$@spelldesc412788\r\n\r\n\r\nDemonic Howl\r\n\r\n$@spellicon412789\r\n$@spelldesc412789", "Armor increased by $403816s1%, Health increased by $403816s6%, chance to be critically hit reduced by $403816s2%, threat increased by $403816s3%, mana gained from Life Tap increased by $403816s4%, damage done decreased by $403816s5%, some abilities modified, and some new abilities granted.", "Shapeshift" },
