  {  407798, "Fills you with holy spirit for $d, causing each of your melee attacks to deal $407799s1% weapon damage to your target, but you lose health equal to $s4% of the damage inflicted. While this seal is active, your party and raid members within $407802a1 yards each gain mana equal to $s2% of damage you take from this seal.\r\n\r\n\r\nUnleashing this Seal's energy will judge an enemy, instantly causing $407803s1% weapon damage at the cost of health equal to $s4% of the damage inflicted.\r\n\r\nThis ability's Seal and Judgement benefit from talents and effects that modify the Seal or Judgement of Seal of Righteousness.", "Melee attacks deal additional damage to your target, but also damage you and generate mana for your party and raid.", 0 },
  {  407802, "Gaining mana from damage received by the Paladin.", 0, 0 },
