  {  407988, "$?a768[|CFFFFFFFFRequires Cat Form|R][|CFFFF2020Requires Cat Form|R]\r\nFinishing move that increases Physical damage done by $s2% while in Cat Form.  Lasts longer per combo point:\r\n   1 point  : ${14+$<points>} seconds\r\n   2 points: ${19+$<points>} seconds\r\n   3 points: ${24+$<points>} seconds\r\n   4 points: ${29+$<points>} seconds\r\n   5 points: ${34+$<points>} seconds", "Physical damage done in Cat Form increased by $s2%.", 0 },
