  {  417141, "$?a5487|a9634|a3025[|CFFFFFFFFReuires Cat Form, Bear Form, Dire Bear Form|R][|CFFFF2020Requires Cat Form, Bear Form, Dire Bear Form|R]\r\nCauses your Mangle ability to strike up to $s3 targets, removes its cooldown, and increases the critical strike chance of your Combo Point-generating abilities by $s1%. Clears and grants immunity to Fear effects for the duration. Lasts $d.", "Combo Point generating abilities gain $s1% increased critical strike chance.\r\nMangle hits up to $w3 targets and has no cooldown.\r\nImmune to Fear effects.", 0 },
  {  417145, "Striking a target with Lacerate, Swipe, or Maul has a $h% chance to reset the cooldown on Mangle (Bear) and grant ${$446699m1/10}  Rage. Striking a target with Mangle (Cat) or Shred has a $s1% chance to reset the cooldown on Tiger's Fury.", 0, 0 },
