  {  417157, "Launch surging stellar energies that cause ${$m1/100*$<damagepower>} to ${$M1/100*$<damagepower>} Arcane damage, and increases the damage done by your next $n Starfire $Lcast:casts; by $s2% for $d.\r\n\r\nStarsurge benefits from and triggers most talents and effects that trigger or benefit from Wrath or Starfire.", "Your next $n Starfire $Lcast deals:casts deal; $s2% increased damage.", 0 },
